      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703819731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An egress gateway (Istio) or\nproxy logs and filters every\noutbound call: which service\ntalked to which domain.\nCompliance, debugging.",
