      "text": "kind: NetworkPolicy\nspec:\n  podSelector: {matchLabels: {app: email}}\n  policyTypes: [Egress]\n  egress:\n  - to: [{podSelector: {matchLabels: {app: postgres}}}]\n    ports: [{port: 5432}]\n  - ports: [{port: 53, protocol: UDP}]   # DNS",
